rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GejXusfIIxoQ7kNvwFQUVKW&_nc_oc=AdrhLnENkxb_ImCItQSeTt17okYVSz5ifWxRn0qTESMACO5bmD_qThpR9RDc6gsUgew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRLJpkbR1m7PSO3WDTje3SexmsgQsHn_JwDtJrhv1aZGA&oe=6B06F8AF"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLJgQfs1CRMQ7kNvwH5Ecv-&_nc_oc=Ado9Ie8JFykp9LchNxSr9Cz5-4Zo2VsUV1aGI_Wlb010IvyD69rKwi8gfJYJ5Y-fVW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRw35W3YhZSlyZIIeT3w_P0KxJpk6k36W4xXl71EMu48w&oe=6B070A9A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F4Dpx0R6nlAQ7kNvwEsoks_&_nc_oc=Adq5J_0dBSeZqrdqwq3q7CQ88vU2CnpnCKy4N1MHh55e3Pj3UwP9eRZqnmEocSPHjgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdDcqeWQDrTVNfHgvODM_ax4ng6_9HuW9GQ8mKk0JudQ&oe=6B0727FC"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon